            "review_title": "Review at Haan - Drink & Eatery",
            "review_text": "Fooddoof!\nSingapore, Singapore145 contributions\n0\nAmazing rooftop experience\nJan 2020\nThis place is a cute rooftop spot, not very highrise but the ambience is amazing. It's a pretty place very instagramable. Food is amazing and the cocktails are good too. It's a chill place to go with friends to enjoy some good tasting and good looking food. Service is good and I would come back here again.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 14, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
