            "review_title": "Review at Haan - Drink & Eatery",
            "review_text": "Q3492Yadrian\nManchester, United Kingdom17 contributions\n0\n1st Time ...... and Last\nFeb 2020\nMy 1st time at this good value for money restaurant with good views over the main pedestrian area. Sadly my last too, due short sighted narrow minded management.\n\nThey had a 2 for one offer on local craft beer. I tried it .... AWFUL, and told them....uuugh.\nWhen the bill came I said I would not pay for it. We are talking £3 on a bill of over £60, the service charge is 5%.... !!\nWe had a \"discussion\", they would not budge, so i paid it.\n\nMy advice .... AVOID THIS PLACE LIKE THE PLAGUE\n\nPoor service, awful so called \"craft\" beer and absolutely no latitude on the final bill\nI will never come here again .... EVER\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 23, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
