            "review_text": "VyBui\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12 contributions\n0\nNice ambience & salad\nSep 2019 • Couples\nWent to this place with my boyfriend last weekend, the place looks new and quite nice. menu is quite standard with some comfort foods, lots of brunch options, since I'm on a keto diet I had a salad and a main - crispy skin pork belly. The salad dressing is spot on, very balanced and the presentation was quite eye catching as well. Pork belly was kinda influenced by Chinese five spice roasted pork, overall good experience!\nRead more\nWritten September 23, 2019",
