            "review_title": "Review at Haan - Drink & Eatery",
            "review_text": "Lucy\n11 contributions\n0\nWorst restaurant: customer service + unstable food quality\nAug 2019 • Friends\nWell, it’s not the first time or second time I went to Haan to be honest. This is after a few times I came to Haan to give my unbiased opinion on this restaurant.\nPros: the decoration and the location are the big compliments\nCons:\n- On my friend’s birthday: I order a drink with a note: no sugar, no condensed milk and replaced with soy milk. The staffs kept asking me stupid questions 3 times and forgot my order. Then I had to remind them to make me the drinks after my friends all got their second drinks or even the third drinks. No apology from them or even the manager. \n- The last time I came to Haan: I ordered the same dish I had on my friend’s birthday, the food took forever as the last time, also the food’s quality and quantity changed completely, I was so disappointed and had to asked the waiter, then he explained it was because they ran out of some stuffs 😂😂😂. Oh please if you don’t have enough, you shouldn’t serve it to your customers. \nI took the pictures so you guys can see I didn’t lie. Better go to other restaurants in town after this\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 25, 2019\nHaan - Drink & Eatery\nDear itslucybae, \nFirst, we would like to thank you for letting us know what went wrong. We take guests’ reviews very seriously and we sincerely apologize for the incident you had experienced. Now, all the issues have been fixed and we assure that this will not occur again. We hope you can give us another try in near future so we can make it up to you.\nHaan Customer Service Team\nRead more\nWritten September 24, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
