            "review_text": "Tu Quynh\n3 contributions\n0\nNice restaurant in District 1\nAug 2019\nGood location as it located in the rooftop of Saigon garden with Nguyen Hue walking street view. My friends and I was so impressed by its unique design that we took so many great photos. The food is good and the cocktail is also great. We went on Happy Hour so we got \"Buy 1 get 1 free\" promotion. Overall, Recommended for groups who find place to chill at the weekend.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 13, 2019",
