            "review_title": "Review at Haan - Drink & Eatery",
            "review_text": "Britta N\nLejre, Denmark8 contributions\n0\nThe nightmare of waiting\nAug 2019 • Family\nWe were a family of 4 that ordered one course each. Due to any kind of coordination in the kitchen we all had to eat alone. \nThe first meal arrived after 1h and 10 minutes waiting! We had almost given up at the last meal after 1h and 30 minutes of waiting and asked for the bill, only then the last meal were served. \nWe have never had such poor service before. \nThe food was okay but the portions were quite small.\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2019\nHaan - Drink & Eatery\nDear Ms. Lebeck P,\nWe’re so sorry for your bad experience at Haan. Last Friday night, our kitchen electrical system had some unexpected issues that technicians could not fix right away. Thus, it took so long for us to serve you dinner. This is not a good excuse but we really hope you understand that we wish we could serve you better. Now, all the issues have been fixed and we assure that this will not occur again. We know that you may never want to revisit our restaurant, but we do hope you will reconsider and give us a second chance to provide you the best dining experience we can.\n\nAgain, we apologize for the frustration and inconvenience that you had at Haan. \n\nSincerely,\nHaan Customer Service\nRead more\nWritten August 5, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
